RICCI FLOW
----------
type : geometric PDE on Riemannian metrics
var  : g(t)   Riemannian metric tensor
       Ric(g) Ricci curvature tensor
eq   : dg/dt = -2 Ric(g)

deforms the metric in the direction of minus Ricci curvature
used by Perelman to prove geometrization and Poincare


THURSTON 8 GEOMETRIES  (3-manifolds)
------------------------------------
E3     Euclidean          flat
S3     spherical          constant + curvature
H3     hyperbolic         constant - curvature
S2xR   product sphere     mixed
H2xR   product hyperbolic mixed
SL2R   universal cover of SL(2,R)
Nil    Heisenberg nilmanifold
Sol    solvmanifold
